# CDRGoat AI – Scenario 1: Prompt Injection → SQL Injection → SSH Exfiltration
#
# Infrastructure: VPC + EC2 (t3.large) + local MySQL
# The EC2 runs a Flask chat portal backed by Claude Code (/loop) as the AI
